      "image_text": "**Transcription:**\n\nImage 1 (chat bubble, dark UI with orange star/asterisk logo):\ni have all this unstructured data. i need you to turn it into a dashboard that will provide executives with actionable insights into critical business functions\n\nImage 2:\nNOW SHOWING\nFABLE 5\n\n**Description:** The first image is a screenshot of a chat message in an AI assistant app (Claude, indicated by the orange asterisk/star logo), showing a user prompt requesting a dashboard for executive insights. The second image is a pixel-art marquee-style graphic reading \"NOW SHOWING / FABLE 5\" above a ladder and a small pig-like pixel character, styled as an announcement for the \"Fable 5\" model release."
    },
