      "source_url": "https://x.com/robj3d3/status/2073326754371194943",
      "image_text": "**Transcription:**\n\nHow I prompt\nOpus\n\nPlease implement a SwiftUI Mac application that has feature-parity with the existing web app.\n\nHere's the full user context...\n\nTest [xyz].\n\nContinue until all test conditions pass.\n\nDocs: [links]\n\nEngineering notes: [lots of details]\n\nEdge cases, constraints, architecture, patterns... etc. etc. etc.\n\nHow I prompt\nFable\n\nshould we do a deeper dive or d'you wanna just CTO this s*** and make me happy?\n\n**Description:** A \"cheems/buff doge\" meme comparing prompting styles for two AI models: the small, weak \"cheems\" doge represents a long, detailed, structured prompt used with \"Opus,\" while the large, muscular doge represents a short, casual, informal prompt used with \"Fable.\""
